    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Power of Synergy in Multi Deck Hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multi Deck Hero</i> is a <strong>roguelike deckbuilder</strong> where strategy and synergy determine your survival. With <strong>three dynamic decks</strong> at your command, you must tactically combine your cards, unlock powerful <strong>charms</strong>, and defeat an endless wave of evolving enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, make the most of your cards, create devastating combos, and discover new strategies with each run. Will you master the perfect deck or fall to the growing challenge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Multi-Deck System</strong> \u2013 Draw and play from three different decks, mixing strategies to outsmart your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Charms</strong> \u2013 Unlock game-changing passive effects that enhance your deck\u2019s synergy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong> \u2013 Face increasingly powerful enemies and adapt to ever-changing challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same, thanks to randomized card offerings and charm combinations.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Build the Ultimate Deck?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, strategize, and prove your skills in <i>Multi Deck Hero</i>! Wishlist now and prepare for the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc49 Wishlist Now!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p>",
